OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FChance of a little light rain
OL,6,Fat first this morning otherwise mainly
OL,7,Fdry, a few showers possible in the far
OL,8,Fwest. Some sunny spells developing
OL,9,Facross the east. Fresh southwesterly
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMainly dry this evening, the
OL,13,Fodd shower possible in the west. Then
OL,14,Fthe rest of the night will be largely
OL,15,Fwith clear periods. Brisk
OL,16,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FMostly dry but patchy rain
OL,19,Fmay affect the south and west at
OL,20,Ftimes. Some hazy sunshine at times.
OL,21,FFresh southwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
