OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FPatchy
OL,6,Frain on Sunday morning clearing south
OL,7,Fto leave a dry and brighter afternoon.
OL,8,FDry with bright spells on Monday and
OL,9,FTuesday.
